      "body": "Classyshark is showing multiple built in trackers, I +1 heavily that these should and need to be removed. This is absurd.\n\nAdjust\nGoogle AdMob\nLeanPlum\n\n*Adjust\n5com.adjust.sdk.\n\n*Google AdMob\n2com.google.android.gms.ads.\n\n*LeanPlum\n1com.leanplum.\n\n\nfile:///data/app/org.mozilla.fennec_fdroid-0mV5JQsbxytxKHdXEf_8dA%3D%3D/base.apk ",
